lemma EffortMint (p:Blush.Cloud R_)(y:(F_).Coeff){a s:ℝ}(h:Graces.Effort (p_) (O_) o_ (Blush.scope (H.sight Z.val) p 0) (Luna.plot H Z.val ℓ F_ p) y va κ a s) :
    let V:= Matric.tell (mei H g Z.val p d); V.Format 0 o_ O_ ∧ V.remBound 0 O_ (Real.sqrt κ) s ∧ Attainment (O_).p (0:Site s₀) (moi H Z.val p d) s ∧ profile (O_).activities V.forced=profile (O_).activities (plot H Z.val ℓ F_ p).forced + hook (O_).activities (O_).p.threshold (moi H Z.val p d):=by
    intro V; let S:= Keeper.supply (keeperF H g Z.val) (fun i=>Local.joint p_ 0 (Blush.scope (H.sight Z.val) p (0:Site s₀) i)); have ht:= (Apse.savory g H Z.val).valid; have hp:0<Real.sqrt κ:= Real.sqrt_pos.mpr (forcedPos ..); have he:Local.Readable (hol G) (p_) (O_).p (A.B.a.S.side m n) va:= Graces.livelyCard b.clock (d:=d) (by omega)
    obtain ⟨a',b',c',h,hF,⟨u,v,hq,hA⟩,hT,-⟩:=h; have hv:= hF.costs_nonneg hp
    have hz:= tab_mint S h ht hp he hF
    let X:= mint S (plot H Z.val ℓ F_ p) o_
    have hV : a'+(b'+c') ≤ s:=(add_le_add_left (le_mul_of_one_le_left hv.1 (xi_pos _)) _).trans hT -- right
    have hS:= hV
    refine ⟨invest X _ (usage S h ht he),tariffs X _ (usage S h ht he) (hz.bound hS),?_, (stows (keeperF H g _) X).trans (budgetProfile S hF h he ht hp)⟩
    exact stackFee (vigor hq h he) (hA.trans_le ((le_add_of_nonneg_right (add_nonneg hv.2.1 hv.2.2)).trans hV))
